# Production config for the admin is NOT kept here.
#
# The admin runs as the `admin` service of the single-VM Docker stack defined in
# quantum-edu-be/deploy/oracle/docker-compose.yml, and all settings (Django secret, superuser,
# demo viewer, MySQL, R2, domain) live in quantum-edu-be/deploy.prod.env:
#
#   cd ../quantum-edu-be
#   ./deploy/oracle/init-env.sh        # once
#   ./deploy.prod.sh                   # deploy everything
#
# From this repo, ./deploy.prod.sh redeploys only the admin container using that same file.
# Override its location with DEPLOY_PROD_ENV_FILE=/path/to/deploy.prod.env if needed.
